>` in machine fields and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`@plan:<path>` in prose — the `plans:` spelling is never emitted [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]again, and every live `plans:` reference on this machine has been [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]migrated.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]plan_ref_kind_rename.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/plan_ref_kind_rename.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-ky[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ky/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the SDD plan-reference grammar in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: rename PLAN_REFERENCE_KIND/PREFIX to plan in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]crates/sase_core/src/plan/refs.rs, keep `plans:` as a read-only input [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]alias that re-renders canonically, and update the Rust tests and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan_reference_render kind guard.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Switch every Python plan-reference literal to plan[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]python[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]python: replace the functional `plans:` literals in src/sase with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single shared constant set to `plan:`, update CLI help and docstrings, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the sidecar ref-kind naming regression test, and fix the 82 affected[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test files plus any visual snapshots.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migrate bead design references[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]beads[dim] · [dim][/dim]after python[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads: add a prefix-only fast path to the design-ref repair planner so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an alias-spelled reference is rewritten without needing its plan file on[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]disk, then run the repair over this machine's bead store and commit the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]result.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rewrite prose and remaining stored references[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]prose[dim] · [dim][/dim]after python[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prose: update the documentation that describes the grammar, then sweep [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prose `plans:<path>` citations to `@plan:<path>` across docs, the plans [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar, ~/.sase/plans, and the two small stored-data sites, without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]touching immutable history.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify and land the rename[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after beads, prose[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: run the exhaustive verification lane over the combined tree, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm no emitter can produce `plans:` again, and land the epic.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ky","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-ky.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-22de57c799f139fc463e219f1a167cf9","started_at":"2026-08-13T16:25:07.653912+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commi